  "summary": "Malicious code in torchserve-cu124-nightly (PyPI)",
  "details": "Package is a dropper pretending to install a torchserve binary. During loading as a module, it downloads and executes a remote file - though in the analyzed version, the remote file was empty, suggesting it waits for weaponization.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-11-torchserve-cu124-nightly\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - Downloads and executes a remote executable.\n\n",
